# Tester of the Tangential (1/1): increment, and "At the beginning of combat on your turn, you may pay {X}. When you do, move X
# +1/+1 counters from this creature onto another target creature." On turn 3 a two-mana Chart a Course is greater than the
# power 1 and the toughness 1, so increment puts a counter on it (2/2). At the beginning of combat Bot1 pays X = 2 with two
# Moxen; the reflexive ability (CR 603.12) chooses its target as it goes on the stack, Bot2's Ornithopter, and only the one
# counter the Tester has moves (CR 122.1): the Tester is a 1/1 again and the Ornithopter a 1/3 with the counter.

